# Optional local consumer map for `npm run sync-consumers`.
# Copy to `consumers.local` (gitignored) and edit paths.
#
# Format: name|src_key|absolute-or-~/dest
# src_key one of:
#   personal-artifact   tokens/dist/personal/artifact.css
#   personal-site       tokens/dist/personal/personal-site.css
#   brand-artifact tokens/dist/brand/artifact.css
#   brand-theme    tokens/dist/brand/theme.css
#   brand-tokens   tokens/dist/brand/tokens.css
#
# Examples:
# my-site|personal-site|~/Projects/my-site/assets/tokens.css
# my-app|personal-artifact|~/Projects/my-app/src/styles/shine-tokens.css
# brand-app|brand-theme|~/Projects/brand-app/src/styles/shine-theme.css

# Nucleus (Clearspeed Operate) — token vendor path for measure-consumers / sync-consumers
# when Justin's machine has a local checkout. Paths are examples only.
# nucleus-app|brand-theme|~/Projects/nucleus/src/styles/shine-theme.css
#
# Tailwind DS lint (N1/D2): Nucleus installs @shadcn/lint@0.2.0 with the Clearspeed
# flat-config recipe in skill/references/clearspeed/shadcn-lint.md — single primary
# TW DS lint (no Oxlint/Biome TW stack). Warn on src/components/**; ratchet to error.

